        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Want to stay on top of the science and politics driving biotech today?&#xa0;<a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/signup/readout/\">Sign up</a>&#xa0;to get our biotech newsletter in your inbox.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Good morning. Hope you all have a great Thanksgiving tomorrow!&#xa0;I will probably be watching 10 hours straight of football.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-fda-approves-cogent-s-drug-for-rare-stomach-cancer\">FDA approves Cogent&#x2019;s drug for rare stomach cancer</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Cogent Biosciences yesterday <a href=\"https://www.fda.gov/drugs/cancer-approvals/fda-approves-bezuclastinib-combination-sunitinib-advanced-gastrointestinal-stromal-tumors\" rel=\"noopener\">won FDA clearance</a> for&#xa0;its stomach cancer treatment, which will be marketed as Ekitna, in combination with a much older drug from Pfizer called Sutent.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/25/biotech-news-fda-approves-cogents-drug-for-rare-stomach-cancer/?utm_campaign=rss\">Continue to STAT+ to read the full story&hellip;</a></p>"
